<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>University of Pittsburgh Club Water Polo Recruitment</title>

<style>

body{
font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
background:#f4f6fb;
margin:0;
padding:0;
}

header{
background:#003594;
color:white;
padding:20px;
text-align:center;
}

header h1{
margin:0;
}

nav{
background:#d1a500;
padding:10px;
text-align:center;
font-weight:bold;
}

.container{
max-width:800px;
margin:auto;
background:white;
padding:30px;
margin-top:30px;
border-radius:8px;
box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

button{
background:#003594;
color:white;
border:none;
padding:12px 18px;
border-radius:5px;
cursor:pointer;
font-size:16px;
}

button:hover{
background:#00256a;
}

input, textarea{
width:100%;
padding:10px;
margin-top:6px;
margin-bottom:15px;
border:1px solid #ccc;
border-radius:4px;
}

#reveal{
display:none;
margin-top:40px;
padding:20px;
background:#fff3cd;
border-left:6px solid #ffcc00;
}

.education{
margin-top:30px;
background:#eef2ff;
padding:20px;
border-radius:6px;
}

.counter{
margin-top:20px;
font-size:14px;
color:#666;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>North Valley University Athletics</h1>
<p>Club Water Polo Recruitment</p>
</header>

<nav>
Incoming Freshman Interest Form
</nav>

<div class="container">

<h2>Club Water Polo – Fall Recruitment</h2>

<p>
Hello! Our Club Water Polo team is currently reaching out to prospective students who may
be interested in joining the program if they attend North Valley University this fall.
</p>

<p>
If you're considering NVU and have experience in swimming, water polo, or aquatics,
we'd love to connect with you.
</p>

<p>
Please complete the short interest form below so our team can follow up.
</p>

<form id="phishForm">

<label>Name</label>
<input type="text" required>

<label>Email</label>
<input type="email" required>

<label>High School</label>
<input type="text">

<label>Water Polo / Swimming Experience</label>
<textarea rows="3"></textarea>

<button type="submit">Submit Interest Form</button>

</form>

<div class="counter">
Page visits: <span id="visitCount"></span><br>
Form submissions: <span id="submitCount"></span>
</div>

<div id="reveal">

<h2>🎣 You've Been Phished!</h2>

<p>
This page was part of a **cybersecurity awareness demonstration**.
Nothing you entered was collected or stored.
</p>

<div class="education">

<h3>What is phishing?</h3>

<p>
Phishing is a social engineering attack where someone pretends to be a trusted
organization in order to trick people into revealing information or clicking malicious links.
Attackers often impersonate universities, companies, banks, or services you trust.
</p>

<h3>Red flags in this example</h3>

<ul>
<li>The message asks you to fill out a form without confirming the sender's identity.</li>
<li>There is no official admissions portal login or verification process.</li>
<li>The page looks legitimate but could be hosted on any random website.</li>
</ul>

<h3>How to avoid phishing scams</h3>

<ul>
<li>Always check the **URL of a website** before entering information.</li>
<li>Verify messages by contacting the organization directly.</li>
<li>Be cautious when forms ask for personal information unexpectedly.</li>
<li>Universities typically communicate through **official admissions portals or email domains**.</li>
</ul>

<p>
Learning to recognize phishing attempts is one of the best ways to stay safe online.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

<script>

let visits = localStorage.getItem("visits");
if(!visits){
visits = 0;
}
visits++;
localStorage.setItem("visits",visits);
document.getElementById("visitCount").innerText = visits;

let submissions = localStorage.getItem("submits");
if(!submissions){
submissions = 0;
}

document.getElementById("submitCount").innerText = submissions;

document.getElementById("phishForm").addEventListener("submit",function(e){

e.preventDefault();

submissions++;
localStorage.setItem("submits",submissions);

document.getElementById("submitCount").innerText = submissions;

document.getElementById("reveal").style.display="block";

window.scrollTo({
top:document.getElementById("reveal").offsetTop,
behavior:"smooth"
});

});

</script>

</body>
</html>
